{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52458","headline":"回波乐 一○一 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 一○一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五体一身内，蛆虫塞破袋。\n中间八万户，常无啾唧声。\n脓流遍身遶，六贼腹中停。\n两两相啖食，强弱自相征（张改作「争」）。\n平生事人我，何处有公名（张改作「平」）。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}